\n\n```\n# Use a pipeline as a high-level helper\nfrom transformers import pipeline\n\npipe = pipeline(\"text-generation\", model=\"Yuivdldk/math-model-l45-g4b-lora-lr0.0001-ep1-s42-ntr11188-mn2048-n2538-rft\")\nmessages = [\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Who are you?\"},\n]\npipe(messages)\n```\n\n```\n# Load model directly\nfrom transformers import AutoModel\nmodel = AutoModel.from_pretrained(\"Yuivdldk/math-model-l45-g4b-lora-lr0.0001-ep1-s42-ntr11188-mn2048-n2538-rft\", device_map=\"auto\")\n```\n\n  * Notebooks\n  *  Google Colab⟨40⟩\n  *  Kaggle⟨41⟩\n  * Local Apps Settings⟨42⟩\n  *  vLLM ⟨43⟩\nHow to use Yuivdldk/math-model-l45-g4b-lora-lr0.0001-ep1-s42-ntr11188-mn2048-n2538-rft with vLLM:\n##### Install from pip and serve model\n\n```\n# Install vLLM from pip:\npip install vllm\n# Start the vLLM server:\nvllm serve \"Yuivdldk/math-model-l45-g4b-lora-lr0.0001-ep1-s42-ntr11188-mn2048-n2538-rft\"\n# Call the server using curl (OpenAI-compatible API):\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/v1/chat/completions\" \\\n\t-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n\t--data '{\n\t\t\"model\": \"Yuivdldk/math-model-l45-g4b-lora-lr0.0001-ep1-s42-ntr11188-mn2048-n2538-rft\",\n\t\t\"messages\": [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"role\": \"user\",\n\t\t\t\t\"content\": \"What is the capital of France?\"\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t]\n\t}'\n```\n\n##### Use Docker\n\n```\ndocker model run hf.co/Yuivdldk/math-model-l45-g4b-lora-lr0.0001-ep1-s42-ntr11188-mn2048-n2538-rft\n```\n\n  *  SGLang ⟨44⟩\nHow to use Yuivdldk/math-model-l45-g4b-lora-lr0.0001-ep1-s42-ntr11188-mn2048-n2538-rft with SGLang:\n##### Install from pip and serve model\n\n```\n# Install SGLang from pip:\npip install sglang\n# Start the SGLang server:\npython3 -m sglang.launch_server \\\n    --model-path \"Yuivdldk/math-model-l45-g4b-lora-lr0.0001-ep1-s42-ntr11188-mn2048-n2538-rft\" \\\n    --host 0.0.0.0 \\\n    --port 30000\n# Call the server using curl (OpenAI-compatible API):\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:30000/v1/chat/comp